{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39134","headline":"贼中与萧韦二秀才同卧重疾二君寻愈余独加焉恍惚之中因有题 · 韦庄","name":"贼中与萧韦二秀才同卧重疾二君寻愈余独加焉恍惚之中因有题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与君同卧疾，独我渐弥留。\n弟妹不知处，兵戈殊未休。\n胸中疑晋竖，耳下鬬殷牛。\n纵有秦医在，怀乡亦泪流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}